 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "The degree-zero Picard functor over a separable closure",
 "statement": "Let $k$ be a field, let $C$ be a\nsmooth projective curve over $k$\nwhich is geometrically integral,\nof genus $g$ ([def-pc-genus]), and let $k_s$ be a\nseparable closure of $k$. Then the\ndegree-zero part\n$\\operatorname{Pic}^0_{C_{k_s}/k_s}$ is representable, and the representing\nobject $J_s$ is an abelian variety over\n$k_s$ of dimension $g$; moreover $J_s(k_s)=\\operatorname{Pic}^0(C_{k_s})$\nunder the canonical identification of [def-sc-pic0].",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-picard-framework/sk-prop-jacobian-descent/thm-pd-geometric-pic0.md",
  "place": "node thm-pd-geometric-pic0, order 858"
 },
 "stmt_deps": [
  "def-pc-genus",
  "def-sc-pic0",
  "def-pc-geometrically-irreducible",
  "def-pc-smooth-projective-curve"
 ],
 "proof": [
  {
   "text": "By [lem-pd-geometric-curve] the curve $C_{k_s}$ is a smooth projective\ncurve over the separably closed field $k_s$ of [def-pd-separable-closure]\nwhich is geometrically integral of genus $g$\n([def-pc-genus]). [thm-sc-jacobian-representability] therefore\nproduces an abelian variety $J_s$ over $k_s$ of dimension $g$, whose defining\nproperty is the isomorphism $\\operatorname{Pic}^0_{C_{k_s}/k_s}\\cong h_{J_s}$\nof [def-sc-jacobian], and it identifies $J_s(k_s)$ with the group\n$\\operatorname{Pic}^0(C_{k_s})$ of [def-sc-pic0]. That theorem\nformulates its functor as the degree-zero part of the Picard functor, which is\nthe subfunctor introduced in [def-pd-degree-morphism]; hence $J_s$\nrepresents $\\operatorname{Pic}^0_{C_{k_s}/k_s}$ in the sense used here.\n[thm-sc-theorem-of-the-base] supplies the same conclusion independently,\ntogether with smoothness, properness and the dimension, which is what makes\n$J_s$ an abelian variety in the sense of [def-sc-abelian-variety].",
   "uses": [
    "lem-pd-geometric-curve",
    "def-pd-separable-closure",
    "def-pc-genus",
    "thm-sc-jacobian-representability",
    "def-sc-jacobian",
    "def-sc-pic0",
    "def-pd-degree-morphism",
    "thm-sc-theorem-of-the-base",
    "def-sc-abelian-variety"
   ],
   "elementary": false
  }
 ],
